  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the audacious world of Böse Buben Tattoo Studio, nestled in the heart of Nuremberg, Germany. Renowned for their mastery of 'trashpolka' tattoo artistry, this studio marries the boldness of streetwear culture with the permanence of ink, promising a tattoo experience that etches both skin and memory with striking design. Step into their realm and let the Böse Buben team draw you into an indelible journey of style and self-expression.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Nuremberg, Bavaria, Germany\n\nWIR ZEICHNEN EUCH FÜRS LEBEN\nTel. +49 151 24111670\nStreetwear, Tattoo & Piercing",
